@startuml KTOB_04_components
title KTOB — Logical Component Model (R1 modular backend)
skinparam componentStyle uml2
component "Angular SPA\n[Vercel]" as Web
actor Reader
node "Spring Boot Application [Render Free]" {
  component "REST API +\nsecurity enforcement" as API
  component "Identity / Privacy" as Identity
  component "Library / Journal" as Library
  component "Catalog / Discovery" as Catalog
  component "Literary Advisor" as Advisor
  component "Acquisition" as Acquire
  component "Provider adapters" as Adapters
}
database "Supabase PostgreSQL" as DB
component "Supabase Auth [EXT]" as Auth
component "Open Library [EXT]" as Open
component "Groq or other AI [EXT]\nprovisional" as AI
component "Seller source [EXT]\nnot selected" as Sellers
Reader --> Web
Web --> API : HTTPS REST / JSON
Web --> Auth : sign-in / session
API --> Identity
API --> Library
API --> Catalog
API --> Advisor
API --> Acquire
Identity --> Auth : verify token claims
Identity --> DB
Library --> DB
Catalog --> DB : optional catalogue cache
Advisor --> DB : conversations / memories
Acquire --> DB : offers / acquisition
Catalog --> Adapters
Advisor --> Adapters
Acquire --> Adapters
Adapters --> Open : metadata
Adapters --> AI : permitted context only
Adapters ..> Sellers : verified offer lookup [pending]
note right of API
One deployment, logical service contracts.
No direct business-data access from browser.
REST/SOAP requirement awaits lecturer confirmation.
end note
@enduml
